---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Resources
description: "Free resources and Band of One products for running client admin in a one-person service business: starter kit, invoice tracker, playbook, workbook and prompt library."
---
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>Resources</h1>
    <p class="lead">Free tools first, then the products we make. Everything is built around the same system you'll find in the articles.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section tight" aria-labelledby="free-title">
    <h2 id="free-title">Free</h2>
    <div class="grid two">
      <article class="card"><h3>The Client Admin Starter Kit</h3><p>10 AI prompts for the admin you do every week, plus a 30-minute weekly review checklist. Delivered by email.</p><p><a class="btn" href="/newsletter/">Get the starter kit</a></p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Invoice Tracker Starter (.xlsx)</h3><p>A small spreadsheet that calculates due dates, days overdue and which payment reminder to send. Formulas tested in LibreOffice; works in Excel and Google Sheets.</p><p><a class="btn ghost" href="/downloads/BandOfOne_Invoice-Tracker-Starter.xlsx" download>Download</a> <a href="/blog/track-invoices-in-a-spreadsheet/">How it works</a></p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section tight" id="products" aria-labelledby="products-title">
    <h2 id="products-title">Products</h2>
    {%- if not site.storeUrl %}<p class="note">The store isn't open yet. Product links will work at launch.</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="grid three">
      {%- for key in ["playbook", "desk", "prompts"] %}{% set p = products[key] %}
      <article class="card product">
        <img src="{{ p.image }}" alt="Cover of {{ p.name }}" width="560" height="725" loading="lazy">
        <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3><p class="price">{{ p.price }}</p><p>{{ p.pitch }}</p>
        {%- if site.storeUrl %}<p><a class="btn" href="{{ site.storeLink(p.slug) }}">{{ p.cta }}</a></p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="card bundle-card">
      <h3>The Complete Bundle: {{ products.bundle.price }}</h3>
      <p>{{ products.bundle.pitch }}</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="/bundle/">See the bundle</a></p>
    </div>
    <p class="small">Educational products and templates. No specific time savings or income are promised. Prices in USD; tax may be added at checkout.</p>
  </section>
</div>
